WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:03.419
Unit nineteen. Road Safety for Teens!

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:08.227
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.277 --> 00:00:11.292
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.342 --> 00:00:15.064
Today we learn about Road Safety for Teens. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:19.336
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

6
00:00:22.819 --> 00:00:26.452
Seatbelt. Say it with me. Seatbelt!

7
00:00:29.969 --> 00:00:33.086
Speed. Say it with me. Speed!

8
00:00:36.559 --> 00:00:40.443
Distraction. Say it with me. Distraction!

9
00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:46.967
Phone. Say it with me. Phone!

10
00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.487
Night. Say it with me. Night!

11
00:00:56.988 --> 00:01:00.422
Passenger. Say it with me. Passenger!

12
00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.829
Law. Say it with me. Law!

13
00:01:10.379 --> 00:01:20.357
Wearing a helmet and seatbelt saves lives. Speed and distraction, like using a phone, cause many crashes. Passengers can speak up, and following the law keeps everyone safe.

14
00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:23.285
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.555 --> 00:01:29.468
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.518 --> 00:01:30.668
Speed!

17
00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:36.687
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.737 --> 00:01:37.887
Passenger!

19
00:01:38.887 --> 00:01:44.152
Did you know? Wearing a good helmet greatly reduces the risk of death in a motorbike crash!

20
00:01:44.202 --> 00:01:46.250
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.643 --> 00:01:55.416
Think and answer. Why is using a phone while riding dangerous?

22
00:01:55.466 --> 00:01:56.616
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.747 --> 00:02:02.922
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.972 --> 00:02:05.641
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

